# The count is the +1/+1 counters the creature had as it left the battlefield (CR 603.10a, 608.2h), not when it came in. Bot1's
# Walking Ballista (X=2) answers Bot2's Lightning Bolt by removing a counter to ping Bot2 (the ability resolves first and Bot2 goes
# to 19). The 1/1 Ballista then dies to the Bolt with one counter, so The Ooze makes one Mutagen token, not two.

